<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" bgcolor="#000000" width="90%" align="center">
<tr>
<table cellspacing="4" cellpadding="0" bgcolor="#EEEEEE" width="100%" align="center">
<td><hr noshade size="1" color="#000000"><font face="verdana" size="2">That&#39;s right, the stinky green dragon of Emerald Jungle is dead. He&#39;s really dead. Way dead. Dead dead dead.<br><br>This time he actually graced us with a Green Scale. &nbsp;Congrats to Skybody, here&#39;s hoping the turn in goes well and you can give Ancient Council it&#39;s second Warrior Epic weapon. &nbsp;Also got 3 spells (Malo, Unspoken Word, and Aegis). &nbsp;Plus he gave someone a Dragon Bone Bracelet, a Pally Burnt Book, and a Treasure Hunter&#39;s Satchel. Grats to all that got stuff.<p></font></td>
</tr>
